+# Synced from bootstrap: repo/tools/git/.gitignore. Do not edit this file.
+# The next sync replaces it, and a manual change is lost.
+
+# Universal ignore set, by tech stack and tool, for every repository.
+# The sync applies [overrides.gitignore] of .config/bootstrap.toml: it
+# comments out each line of remove, then adds the lines of add at the end. A
+# later line wins, so a repository can also negate any pattern here.
+
+# ==== macOS ====
+.DS_Store
+.AppleDouble
+.LSOverride
+._*
+.Spotlight-V100
+.Trashes
+.AppleDB
+.AppleDesktop
+.DocumentRevisions-V100
